Hali is a [[Bestiary/Kaathe|Kaathe]] with extensive memory loss. Her orb was kept in an [[Geography/Althane/Illyara/index|Illyaran]] archive until it was shipped in secret to [[People/Althane/Aliaksandr Sarken|Aliaksandr Sarken]]. After a series of thefts and counter-thefts, the orb came into the hands of [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]]. She and [[People/Althane/Tennobrin Er-K|Tenno]] were then held in the vats of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/RC3|RC3]], and the Weft freed them and took them along.

Hali is a red-glowing, floating, glass orb in the real world, but is a twelve-foot tall, dark-metal and ceramic construct in her dream. She wears a cloak that shades her face, but her single, red-glowing eye is visible in the cowl. Her head is surrounded by a slowly rotating ring of red runes.

Hali is generally harsh and curt, and while she shows an obvious disdain for "meatbags" like the Weft she's still willing to work with them to further her own goals.

The Weft's story began on a train to [[Geography/Althane/Salores/Toleros/index|Toleros]]. Bandits in black and red flannel, lycanthropes, hijacked it and stole its cargo. In Toleros [[People/Althane/Lady Grave|Lady Grave]] hired the Weft to find the missing oneiromancer [[People/Althane/Aliaksandr Sarken|Aliaksandr Sarken]] and recover the cargo. Sarken had fled the country with the Broker's help, leaving an [[Phenomena/Althane/Oneiroscope|oneiroscope]] behind. The Weft followed the bandits to their hideout and stole the cargo back, and on the road opened it: a crystal ball that woke with a red glow and introduced itself as Halidex, Hali for short, an injured Kaathe.

Through the oneiroscope they entered her orb and met Hali and [[People/Althane/Tennobrin Er-K|Tenno]], who had escaped his own orb into hers. The one orb was failing, and their memories were decaying or lost. The Weft did some maintenance on its engine, a chitinous orb two feet across with a violet glow, kept the orb rather than return it, and went looking for Tenno's orb, which led them to [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|the Gulch]]. [[People/Althane/Karkov|Karkov]] later took Hali and Tenno out of it.
